\begin_layout Standard
Assim temos que,
 
\begin_inset Formula $T'=\begin{pmatrix}-\theta'\sin\theta\\
\theta'\cos\theta
\end{pmatrix}=\theta'n$
\end_inset

.
 Logo,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\kappa=\theta'$
\end_inset


\end_layout

